
### Get all products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### Create a product
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "iPhone 17",
  "price": 1200,
  "quantity": 5
}

### Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/1

### Update product
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra",
  "price": 1100,
  "quantity": 15
}

### Delete product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/1


### Get first page
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?page=1&limit=10


### Search Samsung
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?search=samsung

### Search iPhone
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?search=iphone


### Sort by price ascending
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?sortBy=price&order=ASC

### Sort by price descending
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?sortBy=price&order=DESC

### Sort by name
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?sortBy=name&order=ASC

### Sort by quantity
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?sortBy=quantity&order=DESC

### Sort by quantity

GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?minQuantity=10&maxQuantity=50



### Minimum quantity
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?minQuantity=10

### Maximum quantity
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?maxQuantity=50

### Quantity between 10 and 50
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?minQuantity=10&maxQuantity=50

### Combine search, price and quantity
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?search=samsung&minPrice=100&maxPrice=500&minQuantity=10